── UNKNOWN NAME ─────────────────────── E0211_rust_hashmap_type.lt:1:16  [E0211]

Stilt's map is `Map`, not `HashMap`:

  1 │ fn count(ages: HashMap<str, i64>) -> i64 { ages.len() }
    │                ^^^^^^^

Stilt's collections are `List`, `Map` and `Set`, which every module sees without
a `use`.

To fix it, write `Map`:

  1 │ fn count(ages: Map<str, i64>) -> i64 { ages.len() }
    │                ~~~
